# Client

- Routes in `src/App.tsx` with `basename="/abmiti"`. Vite `base` is `/abmiti/`.
- HTTP only through `src/api` and `apiClient` (JWT refresh interceptor).
- Server state: TanStack Query hooks. Auth/month/budget chrome: Zustand stores.
- Import via `@/` (see `vite.config.ts`).
- After mutating entries/budgets, invalidate the same query keys other pages use (`hooks/index.ts`).
- Verify changed flows in the browser, including shared layout and other routes that read the same store/query.
